WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.230
There we go.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.490
<b>Win against McQueen at the Takarazuka Kinen!</b>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.520
I guess I have to give it up.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.000
<b>Letter of Withdrawal</b>

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.010
Like this...

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:59.030
Episode 10
\hOne Day, Without a Doubt

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.010
And then this and that...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.470
And then I have to do like this, and then—

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.470
<b>Good Luck</b>

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.520
Yeowch!

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.160
A-Are you okay, Kita-chan?!

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:04.540
Todally fihe...

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.930
Kita-chan, let me see your hand.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.770
<b>Run at Full Speed</b>

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.170
Thank you, Dia-chan.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:11.550
I know the media and the internet 
are saying all kinds of things.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.150
But I'm sure Teio will be 
glad to have your charm!

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:18.200
<b>Run at Full Speed</b>

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.810
Yeah. I hope so.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.700
<b>Good Luck</b>

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.830
<b>Sharpening Their Fangs for the Kikkashou

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:26.520
Damn it! They just write 
whatever they want, huh?

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.250
All they care about is whether 
or not it gets them attention.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:32.910
Anyone wanna explain where the hell Teio's 
been for the last two or three days?

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.760
Maybe she got sick of us 
having her do errands?

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.480
N-No way...

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.830
Is this my fault?

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.640
I know just the plan to get her back!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.900
Huh?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.110
Huh, what's this?

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.120
Huh, what's this?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.900
Huh, what's this?

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.680
Huh, what's this?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.020
Teio-san!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.010
Guess I'll come back.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:16.000
Spe-senpai, you're the only person 
who would for a trap like that.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.010
I thought it was a good idea!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.910
Are you not worried, McQueen? About Teio.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.890
No matter what becomes of Teio, I will 
continue to do what must be done.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.640
What must be done?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.100
<b>Letter of Withdrawal</b>

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:34.100
I will remain a top horse girl, 
worthy of Teio's ambitions.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.030
<b>Letter of Withdrawal</b>

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:55.080
The racers have entered the final straightaway
 with just over 200 meters left!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.670
Twin Turbo is hanging tough!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.100
Symptom Dash is running on the outside,

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.810
with Spain Jelutong on the 
inside in third place,

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.090
I can't!

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:02.300
but Twin Turbo still has a big lead on both!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.220
Go!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.840
Twin Turbo is roaring out there!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.510
Her turbo engines are at full throttle! 
She outruns the rest!

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.520
Twin Turbo has won the race!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.130
You did it, Turbo!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.890
She doesn't spare anything
when she sprints.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.470
Which is pretty in-character, I guess.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:19.000
I can't imagine Turbo running any other way.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.150
This is her first big win in a while.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.420
Hell yeah! Did you see that, Teio?!

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.910
The way your best rival ever, Turbo, runs?!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.080
Rival?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.120
Well, there's no rule 
saying she can't <i>say</i> that.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.600
An unrequited rivalry, huh?

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:38.340
It's open.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.800
Teio...

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.470
Can we talk for a bit?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.430
You're quitting your team?

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:55.170
Yeah. When I think about not being 
able to run the same way anymore...

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.810
It hurts worse than I imagined.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.320
Then you won't be racing anymore?

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:02.920
Since I sprung that one-sided promise on you,

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.210
I thought I should tell you in person.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:10.620
I wanna be a strong and cool horse 
girl like you, Symboli Rudolf-san!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.950
Teio...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.200
Sorry to bother you with this gloomy talk.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.290
You've already decided, then.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.680
Yeah. Thank you for everything.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.840
H-Hello?

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:31.150
<i>Hana-san... are you doing anything tonight?</i>

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.660
Fine.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.520
Last 20!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.220
I can't!

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.270
I can't...

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.270
Fight, fight, fight, fight!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:47.070
Fight, fight, fight, fight!

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:47.070
Right... I don't have to run anymore.

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.990
Okay, in that case, I'm gonna have fun!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.240
And it's obvious what the first stop is!

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.910
A honey double, extra thick 
and extra rich, please!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.500
Okay, one double, extra thick and 
extra rich, coming right up!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.250
That'll be 1500 yen.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.760
So good!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.020
Nailed it!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:21.040
It really suits you!

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.520
Y-You really think so?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.530
Would you like to try this one on, too?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.200
This color is trending big this summer!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.910
Really? Let's see...

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.970
Th-That's...

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.660
No, thank you.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.660
<b>Karaoke</b>

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.670
<i>So cute!</i>

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.080
<i>Never been to a photo booth before.</i>

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.940
<i>Adorable!</i>

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.380
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:04.330
Man, I did all kinds of stuff!
 What a fun day.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.410
I wonder what I should do tomorrow?

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:17.090
Has one day... always been this long?

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.670
Oh, Teio-san!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:33.750
Kita-chan?

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.760
U-Um, I want you to have this!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.850
<b>Good Luck</b>

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.250
It didn't turn out too good, but...

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.350
I want you to run again, so...

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.240
I worked really hard on it!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:52.490
Thank you. But I'm sorry, I can't accept it.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.730
Bye, now.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:01.500
Um, becoming like you, 
Teio-san... is my dream!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:07.480
Sorry, but you shouldn't. There are 
other girls you should look up to.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:27.980
<b>Letter of Challenj
 I'll be waiting on 9-19 at the
Nakayama Racecourse! —Twin Turbo</b>

