00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:27.980
<b>Letter of Challenj
 I'll be waiting on 9-19 at the
Nakayama Racecourse! —Twin Turbo</b>

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.950
Teio's serious, then.

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:39.150
I happened to overhear.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.450
She's injured pretty badly.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:45.610
Even if she heals, she won't not be 
able to run the same way ever again...

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.210
<b>Letter of Withdrawal</b>

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.260
If she wanted to keep 
going... keep running...

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:53.250
If she felt like that, I'd do 
everything I could to support her.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.670
But if she's given up...

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:59.950
There might not be anything I can do.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:04.650
But somewhere inside, 
I wanna see her running again.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.090
I can't bear to see her give up.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.190
I can't get it out of my head.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:11.150
Even if she's not as good as she used to be,

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.690
I want another chance 
to see her on the track again.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.450
But I can tell she's accepted it.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:22.130
And I'm her trainer, 
so I can't force the issue.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:24.800
What about the others?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.050
I'm going to tell them.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.490
It's the least I can do.

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:32.200
But after everything she's accomplished,

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.060
I don't want her to just 
fade away quietly.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.430
I really want to send her off with a bang.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.480
Can I get another?

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.630
Two of the same, please.

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:42.060
And I'm picking up his tab.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.200
Tonight's my treat.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.620
Hana-san...

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.940
Say what?!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.950
Teio's done racing?!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:57.340
Yeah. That's why she hasn't 
been coming around lately.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.830
This is a joke, right?! It has to be.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.300
This has gotta be rough for her.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:05.540
I can't even imagine what it's like, 
not being able to run anymore.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.150
I'm sure she'll get better!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:11.560
She can eat a lot, and get better, 
and then, I know... I think...

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:18.510
And here I thought no one 
would be around this early.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.010
Teio-san!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.500
Teio...

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.940
I'm sorry, guys. I didn't 
mean to make you worry.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:28.190
Thanks for telling them, Trainer.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.660
Teio-san...

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.530
Listen, Teio, can I propose something?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.280
What is it?

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.660
You know the big fan festival 
that's in September?

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.170
Why don't you perform there?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.170
You can express yourself to the people 
who supported you this whole time.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.920
We'll help, too!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.670
It's the least we can do!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.320
I'm in!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.270
Me too!

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.680
Teio-san...

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.330
Thanks, guys.

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:09.940
Teio...

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:16.970
I can't believe Teio-san 
can't run anymore!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.970
Sorry, McQueen. I know 
I'm breaking our promise.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.700
I'm going to keep running.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:24.320
I'll remain the strongest horse girl,
no matter what happens to you.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.230
Yeah. I think that's for the best.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.710
Good luck.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:31.940
Excuse me, then.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:44.010
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:44.010
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.510
<b>Tracen Academy Fan Appreciation Festival</b>

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.520
<b>9-19
 Autumn Fan Appreciation Festival</b>

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.540
Good work.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:06.050
You're supposed to be working on your starts.
Why are you dashing at full speed?

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.090
I like to start at full power!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:10.010
Nothing beats being in 
first for the whole race!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.850
Just you wait, Teio! I'm gonna 
beat you in the fall race!

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.040
But I'm going to beat Teio first.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:20.690
Nuh-uh, it'll be me! I gave her a challenge 
after I won the Tanabata Sho!

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:21.200
Right?!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.080
R-Right...

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.320
Wasn't that a while ago?

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.890
Did she ever actually answer?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:28.720
Bwuh?

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.380
Right this way.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.140
Frankfurters

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.140
<b>Candied Apples</b>

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.980
A little bit more...

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.310
Lower it slowly, now.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.030
McQueen...

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.630
How's everything going?

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.940
Thank you for your help, President.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:48.280
Everyone is excited to 
see Teio take the stage.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.040
I'm telling you, we should use this one!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.790
<b>Spica Presents:
 Tokai Teio 
Special Concert</b>

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:50.790
No, this one!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.290
<b>Spica Presents:
Tokai Teio
 Special Concert</b>

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.150
This color is way more Teio-ish!

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.290
No, this one is!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.170
Would you two give it a rest already?!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.040
It's her fault!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.070
Get it together! Are you trying 
to ruin Teio's big moment?

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.180
And are you ever gonna stop crying?!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.920
Teio-san...

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:07.180
You seem a little upset.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.810
I suppose... I am.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.290
The thought of her leaving me...

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:17.190
I don't know if I'll be able to 
believe it until it actually happens.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.310
I feel the same way.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.570
Okay, it doesn't hurt anymore. 
I should be able to manage—

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.080
I found you, Teio!

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.790
Hey, it's you...

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:36.660
Double Jet.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.160
It's Twin Turbo!
You got every word wrong!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:44.550
Did you see my challenge? 
When are you gonna race me?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.550
I'm gonna be in the next All Comers race!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.190
A bunch of good runners are! 
There's Ikuno, and, uh...

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.520
And, like, Rice Shower, too!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.270
So we can race there!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.110
The registration period is already over.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.410
Besides, I'm not racing anymore.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.650
Huh?! Why?!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.960
What do you mean, "why?"

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.380
Okay, then, if I win the All Comers,
will you promise to race me next time?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.160
That's just it. I'm not 
racing at all anymore.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.110
No way, no way, no way!

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:13.960
You have to race me! Cuz I'm gonna win!
 I'll leave you in the dust!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.170
I'm done with racing. 
You'll just have to give it up.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.770
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:21.540
The real Teio would never 
give up! Never ever!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.420
What do you know about me?!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.720
If it can't be done, 
I just have to accept it.

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.890
Even if it hurts so, so much...

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.300
I don't care about that!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.930
But the Teio I know never ever gives up!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:39.090
Rice is racing too, right? And a 
lot of other strong horse girls.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.050
You can't outrun them all.

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:44.360
I will win! I'll outrun them all and win!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.780
You're just a big, dumb jerk, Teio!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.040
Step, step, jump, then step...

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.370
Teio, you stupid jerk!

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:04.380
Turbo? What's the matter?

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.380
Ikuno!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.880
It sucks so, so, so bad!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.140
So, so, so bad!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.140
I see... then Teio's giving up.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:16.960
I'm gonna do it! I'm gonna outrun them 
all right in front of Teio and win!

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:19.640
I'm gonna prove what happens 
if you don't give up!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.630
I don't think you'll be able to.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.000
The All Comers race is the 
same day as the Fan Festival.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:28.320
I don't think Teio will be able to watch you.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.280
Oh, no!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.070
Trainer, you have to do something!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.480
I'm not sure what you want me to...

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.000
No, no, no!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.080
I wanna show Teio how I run!

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.210
Trainer...

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.140
I'm asking, too.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:45.270
Trainer.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.770
I understand.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:50.340
Here's what we'll do...

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.780
First, you'll need to wear these...

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:55.850
<b>Go! Canopus!</b>

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:55.850
<b>Strike while the iron is hot</b>

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:55.850
Okay.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.350
<b>Candle Art</b>

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.870
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.470
<b>Tracen Academy Fan Appreciation Festival</b>

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.470
<b>Tracen Academy Fan Appreciation Festival</b>

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.980
<b>Iwate & Kochi Products</b>

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.310
<b>Planetarium Show</b>

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.480
<b>Gold City's
 Beauty Parlor</b>

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.990
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:06.250
Guys, thank you so much.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.120
Don't sweat it. Go wrap it up out there.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:10.040
It's hard to say this, but...

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.360
Make sure you don't have any regrets, okay?

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.620
Teio-san!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.520
Aw, come on, stop crying!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:27.970
All right, I'm gonna go on now. 
I'll make this the best goodbye ever!

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:35.940
Teio!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:46.040
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.050
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.360
Thank you all for coming.

00:17:55.360 --> 00:18:01.570
I'm so glad so many people came to see me, 
even though I haven't been running at all!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:06.430
I'm pretty sure you all know this,
 but I broke my leg again!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.300
This was the third time, 
if you can believe it!

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:09.720
It's almost kinda impressive, huh?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.160
After so many times, 
I'm practically used to it.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.170
Or at least, I thought I would be.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:19.310
But...

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:22.040
That's why...

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.810
When it comes to racing... 
I don't think I can...

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.990
I can't...

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.800
Teio-san! I'll be waiting!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:04.280
I'll always be waiting to 
see you run again some day!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.790
<b>Good Luck</b>

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.450
Teio!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.600
I don't care if this is me 
being self-centered or greedy!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:13.250
<b>Teio</b>

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.530
You've gotta run again!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:14.290
Trainer...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.500
Teio! Teio!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.610
You have to show us the Teio Step again!

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:19.570
You look your best when on the track!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.010
Don't let some injury get you down!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.070
You're not beat yet!

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:23.360
You're in the process of winning!

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.490
They're right!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.840
Please, Teio!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.210
Don't let it end like this!

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.230
Come on, Teio!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.410
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.260
Guys...

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.110
How much longer?

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:38.740
Is there... no hope?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.370
Six seconds.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.000
Make it quick!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:38.740
Right!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.820
<i>The stands are left in shock!</i>

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.490
<i>Twin Turbo has gone all-in
 on this outrun effort!</i>

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:48.490
<i>She has such a huge lead that it's hard 
to estimate the distance at this point!</i>

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.420
Was this part of the performance?

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.500
What the hell?!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.530
This wasn't part of the program!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:54.990
I'll have them cancel—

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.220
It's fine. I gave the authorization.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.710
I'm sorry. I forgot to tell you.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:02.050
<i>Twin Turbo is on the run! 
She's way out in front!</i>

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.800
Her turbo engines are firing
on all cylinders again!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.690
Entering the third corner and 
she's still accelerating!

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.310
She's letting it all out on the track today!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.480
Twin Turbo's running like 
a fugitive, in first place!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:13.100
Trying to close the distance is the favorite,
 Rice Shower, ready to move into third!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.140
She's currently in fourth place

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:19.740
with her defeat of the top horse girl,
 Mejiro McQueen, still fresh!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.740
Go for it! Turbo!

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.770
<i>But will the Ebon Stayer manage to catch up?!</i>

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:26.050
<i>Second place, Weiss Stone, is somewhere 
between 1 to 3 seconds behind Twin Turbo,</i>

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:28.360
<i>with Imperial Thalys in third!</i>

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.620
<i>But we're already seeing Twin Turbo,
 and only Twin Turbo,</i>

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.740
enter the curve of the fourth corner!

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:35.610
Twin Turbo is still on the run!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:37.340
<i>Twin Turbo is still on the run!</i>

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.910
And as we enter the final straightaway, 
Rice Shower is finally closing in!

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:43.130
But Twin Turbo is passing 
the 200 meter marker!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.800
Can Rice Shower make up 
the difference in time?

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:52.460
This is what happens when you don't give up!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.070
<i>It doesn't look like Rice Shower will reach her!</i>

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:57.700
Tokai Teio!

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.730
Number 11, Twin Turbo!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:05.050
The runaway Twin Turbo pulls it off!

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:07.400
Eat that... Teio...

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:11.740
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.750
Teio-san!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.810
Well, this is a total mess.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.120
Yes, it is.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:24.030
There's still so much 
I want to learn from you!

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:25.380
Please, come back!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.800
We're begging you, Teio!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.080
We'd miss you too much!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.470
Please come back! Let's run together again!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.550
Come on back.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.230
I'll say it again...

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.570
No matter what happens to you...

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:42.010
No matter what anxiety or 
difficulties stand in your way,

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:44.150
I will continue to run...

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:47.100
So that I can remain the top horse girl.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:52.020
But... I might not be able 
to catch up to you anymore.

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:57.580
Miracles can happen when people 
wish and strive for them.

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:59.960
I'm sure of that.

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:06.430
Teio! Teio! Teio!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>Tokai Teio Short Performance</b>

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:34.560
Teio! Teio! Teio!

00:22:25.270 --> 00:22:28.680
Well, if you're all gonna be like that...
What else can I say?

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:30.760
Watch me, everybody...

00:22:31.770 --> 00:22:34.040
I'm gonna try again!
